WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.140
Your first home is a big moment.

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:09.260
The place where you get started — where you build your life and make memories.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:11.560
But life doesn't stand still.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:16.560
And sometimes, the home that was perfect a few years ago isn't quite perfect anymore.

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:21.780
Maybe you want a little more space. A bigger garden. A better location.

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:25.140
Or simply somewhere that feels like the next chapter.

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:30.240
Moving home is also a natural time to review what your next mortgage could look like.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.280
Because what suited a first purchase may not suit a later move.

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:37.240
An adviser can help you review the options.

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:41.620
You can have that conversation from home, at a time that works for you.

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:45.080
We'll look at it together and help you understand your options.

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:50.640
Because life is busy enough. Mortgage advice that fits around your life can help.

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:53.500
Your first home was about getting started.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:54.920
Your next home is about moving forward.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:01.800
And when life moves on, it can help to review your mortgage as you go.
